{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261117%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳案　前夫、家翁及大伯否認謀殺罪｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　25庭　暫委法官鄧少雄<br/>興達大廈大維修圍標案｜續審<br/>► 1430　27庭　法官高勁修<br/>反恐罪脫被告吳子樂被控煽惑暴動等3罪｜提訊<br/>► 1145　26庭　法官嚴舜儀<br/>涉元朗駕車撞倒父子受傷老翁其後不治　休班警被控危駕致他人死亡｜提訊</p>\n<p>🔸東區法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　總裁判官蘇惠德<br/>港大副教授涉收賄220萬元　批出IT教育項目訂單　與供應商等4人被控11罪｜轉介文件</p>\n<p>🔸沙田法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　裁判官黃國輝<br/>休班警荔景站偷拍女子裙底罪成｜判刑</p>\n<p>🔸觀塘法院<br/>► 0930　8庭　裁判官劉淑嫻<br/>公務員涉於藍田交通交匯處電梯　企圖偷拍女子私密部位｜開審</p>\n<p>🔸粉嶺法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　裁判官陳炳宙<br/>宏福苑五級火　36歲無業漢涉冒認災民騙款1.8萬元｜再提堂</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T12:38:17.960282+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":465,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T12:17:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T02:40:12.635482+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T12:31:08.909966+00:00","content_hash":"ed35dd2ed7f3c800b3fcaa891fe11e2a71a1ade7bb2bec5b5e0a6bb4f94b6b43","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}